CaveOfOrigin_B4F_Text_BrandonIntro::
	.string "So, you made it this far. I am BRANDON,\n"
	.string "the final challenge of your Hoenn journey.\p"
	.string "The three legendary golems will test your\n"
	.string "strength, and my partners will test your\l"
	.string "ability to adapt. Show me your true power!$"

CaveOfOrigin_B4F_Text_BrandonDefeat::
	.string "Incredible! You have mastered every\n"
	.string "challenge I could offer. Hoenn is yours!$"

CaveOfOrigin_B4F_Text_BrandonAfterBattle::
	.string "A victory worthy of a true legend.\p"
	.string "Train hard, keep exploring, and never\n"
	.string "stop seeking new challenges. Until we\l"
	.string "meet again, {PLAYER}!$"
